			<orm:EntityType id="_937669D7-BDC9-441A-8863-EDB52B548084" Name="KitLine" _ReferenceMode="id">
				<orm:Notes>
					<orm:Note id="_0F81BB92-2FB4-4EDB-BFE3-9429BB82EF9E">
						<orm:Text>A kit: an item made of others, so many of each for a batch of it; a
batch is its yield, one where none is said. Assembled ahead and kept as
stock; or a phantom, never kept: its sale lines are expanded into lines
of its components, and those are shipped.</orm:Text>
					</orm:Note>
				</orm:Notes>
				<orm:PlayedRoles>
					<orm:Role ref="_73F1F33A-C16D-43E7-BC4A-8B7F708D9256" />
