			<orm:Fact id="_473A0203-4AA7-4DD0-8CCF-DED391BB674F" _Name="EventHappenedInTimeZone">
				<orm:Notes>
					<orm:Note id="_FD687564-C882-4FC4-8AC2-B6F10DD073FE">
						<orm:Text>Where it happened: the zone of the device it was logged on, as it was
logged. Its day is taken there (an oil change at 02:00 on 1 June in
Almaty is of 1 June, though it was 31 May in UTC); one of no zone is
taken where its vehicle's owner lives.</orm:Text>
					</orm:Note>
				</orm:Notes>
