								<orm:Body>For each SaleLine and Quantity, that SaleLine has outstanding Quantity if and only if that SaleLine is for some Quantity1 and possibly has shipped some Quantity2 and possibly has shipped some Quantity3 in its components and Quantity is Quantity1 minus Quantity2, or Quantity3, or 0 where there is none where there is none and Quantity is greater than 0.</orm:Body>
