								<orm:Body>For each SaleOrder, that SaleOrder is partly shipped if and only if some SaleLine1 is of that SaleOrder and SaleLine1 has shipped some Quantity1 and some SaleLine2 is of that SaleOrder and SaleLine2 has outstanding some Quantity2 and Quantity1 is greater than 0.</orm:Body>
