			<orm:Fact id="_568262E1-F377-48C0-84CA-3F8871E0ABC2" _Name="SaleLineIsPartOfSaleLine">
				<orm:Notes>
					<orm:Note id="_B69670D6-48F3-41C1-ABD5-DA1D8E3CE91C">
						<orm:Text>A phantom kit's sale line, expanded: a line of each component, of the
same order, for as many as its kits take; the kit's line has the price,
a component's none. How many kits have gone out is worked out back from
its components' lines (contracted): whole batches of the least shipped.</orm:Text>
					</orm:Note>
				</orm:Notes>
