							<orm:DerivationNote id="_2C9365E3-1F15-4FD8-88DC-CF1FC0D794BF">
								<orm:Body>For each StockItem and Quantity, that StockItem has committed Quantity if and only if some SaleLine is for that StockItem and that SaleLine has outstanding some Quantity and that SaleLine is of some SaleOrder that is in some OrderState and that OrderState is 'Confirmed' and Quantity is the total of that Quantity for that StockItem.</orm:Body>
