						<orm:InformalRule>
							<orm:DerivationNote id="_8E5BFFD6-C4A8-40A3-9023-55B176D073B4">
								<orm:Body>For each ReorderRule, that ReorderRule is due if and only if that ReorderRule reorders below some Quantity1 and is for some StockItem that possibly has available some Quantity2 and possibly that StockItem has incoming some Quantity3 and Has is Quantity2, or 0 where there is none plus Quantity3, or 0 where there is none and Has is less than Quantity1.</orm:Body>
